{"s":"LOW","updated":"2026-10-25T03:01:11.536904+00:00","profile":{"name":"Lowe's Companies, Inc.","summary":"Lowe's Companies, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates as a home improvement retailer in the United States and Canada. It provides a line of products for construction, maintenance, repair, remodeling, and decorating. The company also offers home improvement products, such as appliances, seasonal and outdoor living, lumber, lawn and garden, kitchens and bath, hardware, building materials, millwork, paint, rough plumbing, tools, electrical, flooring, and décor. In addition, it provides installation services through independent contractors in various product categories; and extended protection plans and repair services. Further, the company provides design, distribution, and installation services for interior surface finishes to home builders and property managers. It sells its national brand-name merchandise and private brand products to professional customers, individual homeowners, and renters. The company serves its products through Lowes.com website, mobile applications, retail home improvement stores and outlet stores, and its branches. Lowe's Companies, Inc. was founded in 1921 and is based in Mooresville, North Carolina.","industry":"Home Improvement Retail","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","employees":300000,"address":"1000 Lowes Boulevard, Mooresville, NC 28117, United States","phone":"704 758 1000","website":"https://corporate.lowes.com","ir":"http://phx.corporate-ir.net/phoenix.zhtml?c=95223&p=irol-IRHome","exchange":"NYSE","officers":[{"n":"Mr. Marvin R. Ellison","t":"President, CEO & Chairman","age":60,"pay":4838527},{"n":"Mr. Brandon J. Sink CPA","t":"Executive VP & CFO","age":49,"pay":1814175},{"n":"Ms. Seemantini Godbole","t":"Executive VP and Chief Information & AI Officer","age":55,"pay":1801639},{"n":"Mr. William P. Boltz","t":"Executive Vice President of Merchandising","age":62,"pay":1935156},{"n":"Mr. Joseph Michael McFarland III","t